, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, Sales, Marketing, Business Development, Project Planning and Management, Manpower Management, CRM and Customer Support, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations. The implementation will focus on asset management, fleet management, budgeting and forecasting, contract management, and the integration of AI for enhanced operational efficiency. The project will also involve creating dashboards for each department head, automating processes, and utilizing AI for forecasting and decision-making. Specific functionalities include multi-currency and VAT compliant accounting, automated VAT return filing, real-time sales reporting, vendor management, multi-location inventory tracking, field route planning, contract management, and performance KPIs. Additionally, the project will include automated workflows for approvals, a centralized customer database, and integration with various Zoho applications to streamline operations.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":null,"status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"Implement a fully integrated Zoho business management system covering finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR.","team_members":[],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)x","total_budget":null,"training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-22T02:18:06.803Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["https://yoxtsymyhtuhdnaszkzq.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/proposal-audio/216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1768893367600-ztn628nto.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV82MTc5MjI4Mi0yYjA4LTRiZmEtYWU1Ni1lZGNkZjIyN2ZhYWUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwcm9wb3NhbC1hdWRpby8yMTZlYTA3NS03MmVkLTQ2MmYtYTQwNC1lYjQ5YTA5MTg3MDIvOWMzMWZlODMtOGJlNi00NjA1LWE1NDUtZWU2ZjFjZThmODhiLzE3Njg4OTMzNjc2MDAtenRuNjI4bnRvLm1wMyIsImlhdCI6MTc2ODg5MzM3MSwiZXhwIjoxNzY4ODk2OTcxfQ.1FtjvOqaj2iHckWBQiGOwC4aKmiEZ0PXctCTgjaRDW4"],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":"freshnow@gmail.com","client_name":"freshnow.co","created_at":"2026-01-20T01:46:11.556Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":"2026-01-20","deliverables":["Zoho Books configuration with UAE VAT compliance"],"document_storage_paths":["https://yoxtsymyhtuhdnaszkzq.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/proposal-documents/216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1768893366850-ettz65cg7.docx?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV82MTc5MjI4Mi0yYjA4LTRiZmEtYWU1Ni1lZGNkZjIyN2ZhYWUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwcm9wb3NhbC1kb2N1bWVudHMvMjE2ZWEwNzUtNzJlZC00NjJmLWE0MDQtZWI0OWEwOTE4NzAyLzljMzFmZTgzLThiZTYtNDYwNS1hNTQ1LWVlNmYxY2U4Zjg4Yi8xNzY4ODkzMzY2ODUwLWV0dHo2NWNnNy5kb2N4IiwiaWF0IjoxNzY4ODkzMzcxLCJleHAiOjE3Njg4OTY5NzF9.QZj0gKhnk82S16sGqv3Yr6y7Bc7Cjj4s0KFoEk5c-SQ"],"duration_business_days":30,"end_date":"2026-02-20","executive_summary":"This proposal presents a detailed plan for the **end-to-end implementation of the Zoho business management system** for **FreshNow**. Our primary objective is to **centralize operations** and enhance **data visibility** across all business functions, including finance, sales, inventory, and HR. By automating processes, we aim to empower FreshNow with the tools necessary for informed decision-making, thereby driving overall efficiency and growth.\n\nThe implementation will focus on configuring **Zoho Books** to ensure compliance with UAE VAT regulations, alongside integrating various Zoho applications tailored to FreshNow's operational needs. Our experience with similar projects positions us to deliver a solution that not only meets current demands but also scales with FreshNow's growth into the future.","extraction_job_id":null,"extraction_progress":0,"extraction_status":null,"goals":"Centralize operations, improve data visibility, automate processes, and enable informed decision making","id":"7ae412d6-faa4-4908-903f-a0bb0c3e7e8d","implementation_timeline_table":[{"phase":"Discovery & Planning","scope":"Requirements gathering, configuration planning, project timeline establishment","timeline":"Jan 21 - Jan 25"},{"phase":"Zoho Books Configuration","scope":"Setting up accounting, financial reporting, and VAT compliance","timeline":"Jan 26 - Feb 03"},{"phase":"Sales and Inventory Management Setup","scope":"Inventory tracking, sales processes, integration with Zoho Books","timeline":"Feb 04 - Feb 10"},{"phase":"CRM Implementation","scope":"Customer data migration, sales pipeline configuration, integration with existing tools","timeline":"Feb 08 - Feb 15"},{"phase":"Project Management Functionalities","scope":"Setup of project tracking tools, team collaboration features","timeline":"Feb 11 - Feb 16"},{"phase":"HR Integration","scope":"Employee data setup, payroll configuration, compliance checks","timeline":"Feb 14 - Feb 18"},{"phase":"Testing & QA","scope":"System testing, user acceptance testing, final adjustments","timeline":"Feb 19 - Feb 20"}],"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[{"title":"Financials, VAT, and Core Setup"}],"objectives":"- Centralize all operational processes within the Zoho ecosystem\n- Improve data visibility across finance, sales, inventory, and HR departments\n- Automate key business processes to enhance operational efficiency\n- Ensure compliance with UAE VAT regulations through Zoho Books configuration\n- Provide real-time analytics for informed decision-making across all levels of the organization","parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":"proposal-7ae412d6-faa4-4908-903f-a0bb0c3e7e8d","rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"Implementation of finance, VAT, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, HR, integrations, and analytics using Zoho ecosystem","scope_of_work":"## Project Objective\n- **Implement a fully integrated Zoho business management system** covering finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR.\n- **Goals:** Centralize operations, improve data visibility, automate processes, and enable informed decision-making.\n\n## Modules and Functional Scope\n### A. Financial Management\n- **Chart of Accounts Setup**: Establish a structured chart of accounts tailored to FreshNow's business needs.\n- **Accounts Receivable and Payable Management**: Streamline the management of incoming and outgoing payments.\n- **Cash and Bank Transactions**: Facilitate daily cash management and bank reconciliation.\n- **Budgeting and Cost Center Tracking**: Implement budgeting tools for better financial oversight.\n- **Fixed Asset Management**: Track assets and their depreciation.\n- **Multi-Currency and VAT Compliant Accounting**: Ensure compliance with UAE VAT regulations using Zoho Books.\n- **Dashboards**: Create dashboards for cash flow, margins, and profit & loss statements.\n\n### B. VAT and Compliance\n- **VAT Configuration**: Set up VAT parameters in accordance with UAE FTA guidelines.\n- **Automated VAT Return Filing**: Implement tools for automatic VAT reporting.\n- **VAT Audit Trail**: Establish a system for tracking VAT-related transactions.\n\n### C. Sales and Receivables\n- **Customer Master and Credit Control**: Manage customer accounts and credit limits.\n- **Sales Order, Delivery, Invoice Management**: Automate sales processes from order to cash.\n- **Integration with TeleVend**: Sync vending machine data for real-time inventory management.\n\n### D. Inventory Management\n- **Multi-Location Inventory Tracking**: Monitor stock levels across warehouses and vending machines.\n- **Stock Transfers and Adjustments**: Manage stock movement efficiently.\n- **Cost Per Cup Analysis**: Calculate profitability per vending transaction.\n\n### E. CRM and Customer Support\n- **Centralized Customer Database**: Maintain a single source of truth for customer information.\n- **Complaint and Feedback Tracking**: Automate responses to customer inquiries and complaints.\n\n### F. Project Planning and Management\n- **Project and Campaign Planning**: Define project milestones and budgets.\n- **Task Assignment and Progress Tracking**: Facilitate team collaboration and task management.\n\n### G. HR Management\n- **Employee Data Integration**: Incorporate attendance, payroll, and performance metrics.\n- **Attendance and Leave Management**: Streamline employee attendance tracking.\n\n## Integration Requirements\n- **TeleVend API**: Integrate with vending machines for stock data.\n- **Google Maps**: Utilize for route planning and optimization.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Implementation of third-party systems not within the Zoho ecosystem.\n- Data migration from legacy systems outside of specified Zoho modules.","scope_of_work_introduction":"This engagement focuses on the implementation of a comprehensive **Zoho business management system** for **FreshNow**, aimed at centralizing operations and enhancing data visibility across various business functions. The objective is to automate processes that empower informed decision-making, ultimately driving operational efficiency and improving overall productivity.","scope_of_work_summary":"**Key Deliverables:** Configuration of Zoho Books for UAE VAT compliance, implementation of various Zoho modules including finance, sales, inventory, and HR systems.\n\n**Approach:** A phased implementation strategy with clear milestones to ensure alignment with business goals.","start_date":"2026-01-21","status":"approval_pending","submitted_to":["Mr. Jack"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"End-to-end Zoho business management system implementation for FreshNow","team_members":[{"experience":"3","role":"Zoho Solution Architect"}],"team_structure_min_experience":3,"team_structure_table":[{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Solution Architect","Experience":"3+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Design and implement the Zoho ecosystem, ensure compliance with UAE VAT, and provide strategic guidance throughout the project."}],"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Freshnow","total_budget":"10000","training_and_support":"## Training and Support Plan\n\nOur training and support structure will ensure that FreshNow's team is well-equipped to utilize the new system effectively:\n\n- **User Training (12 hours total):** Comprehensive sessions for key stakeholders covering Zoho functionalities, data management, and reporting capabilities.\n- **Admin Training (6 hours):** In-depth training for system administrators on configuration, maintenance, and troubleshooting of Zoho applications.\n- **Documentation:** Detailed user manuals and technical documentation, including setup instructions and best practices for ongoing operations.\n\n## Post-Implementation Support\n\n- **30-day post-launch support:** Dedicated support with a response time of 2 hours for critical issues.\n- **Weekly check-ins:** During the first month to address any operational challenges and optimize usage of the Zoho system.","updated_at":"2026-01-20T01:49:16.646Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["https://yoxtsymyhtuhdnaszkzq.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/proposal-audio/9f4c2d6a-1b3e-4c9a-8e22-7a91d5f0c321/test_audio_freshnow.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV82MTc5MjI4Mi0yYjA4LTRiZmEtYWU1Ni1lZGNkZjIyN2ZhYWUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwcm9wb3NhbC1hdWRpby85ZjRjMmQ2YS0xYjNlLTRjOWEtOGUyMi03YTkxZDVmMGMzMjEvdGVzdF9hdWRpb19mcmVzaG5vdy5tcDMiLCJpYXQiOjE3Njg1MzkzNDYsImV4cCI6MTc2ODU3NTM0Nn0.c6tPeVjP3h5g3VIdUzW-mN-6hH7C1nEMYee75U6G3kM"],"billing_type":"phase_based","client_email":"info@freshnow.com","client_name":"FreshNow Management","created_at":"2026-01-15T23:27:02.152Z","created_by":"b729e698-222a-42b8-8ae0-31f3ca9d0172","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":"2025-01-10","deliverables":["Zoho Books configuration with UAE VAT compliance","Sales, purchase, and inventory workflow automation","TeleVend integration for real-time vending data","CRM setup for vending locations and accounts","Operational and field service management (Phase 2)","HR integration with KEKA and migration to Zoho People","Project management and collaboration setup","Consolidated dashboards and analytics"],"document_storage_paths":["https://yoxtsymyhtuhdnaszkzq.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/proposal-documents/9f4c2d6a-1b3e-4c9a-8e22-7a91d5f0c321/test_doc_freshnow.txt?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV82MTc5MjI4Mi0yYjA4LTRiZmEtYWU1Ni1lZGNkZjIyN2ZhYWUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwcm9wb3NhbC1kb2N1bWVudHMvOWY0YzJkNmEtMWIzZS00YzlhLThlMjItN2E5MWQ1ZjBjMzIxL3Rlc3RfZG9jX2ZyZXNobm93LnR4dCIsImlhdCI6MTc2ODUzOTM3OSwiZXhwIjoxNzY4NTc1Mzc5fQ.lg8K1Jczl44wFYu9xB0dxCQWkXmA7ah8fmTE0QeiUOE"],"duration_business_days":149,"end_date":"2025-06-30","executive_summary":"This proposal outlines our strategy for implementing an **end-to-end Zoho business management system** for **FreshNow Management**, aimed at centralizing operations and enhancing data visibility across the **Food & Beverage / Vending Operations** sector. Our approach will automate key processes, enabling informed decision-making and streamlining your business operations.\n\nBy leveraging the full range of the Zoho ecosystem, we will configure Zoho Books for UAE VAT compliance, automate sales and inventory workflows, and integrate real-time vending data through TeleVend. This transformation will support FreshNow in achieving operational excellence and gaining competitive advantages in the market.","extraction_job_id":null,"extraction_progress":0,"extraction_status":null,"goals":"Centralize operations, improve data visibility, automate processes, and enable informed decision making","id":"4402d1ac-8ad4-4a5a-9907-187f1e6abcf1","implementation_timeline_table":[{"phase":"Discovery & Planning","scope":"Requirements gathering, project planning, environment setup","timeline":"Feb 1 - Feb 10"},{"phase":"Financials, VAT, and Core Setup","scope":"Zoho Books configuration, VAT compliance setup","timeline":"Feb 11 - Feb 28"},{"phase":"Sales, Purchase, Inventory & CRM","scope":"Sales and inventory automation, CRM setup for vending locations","timeline":"Mar 1 - Mar 31"},{"phase":"Integrations & Analytics","scope":"TeleVend integration, consolidated analytics dashboards","timeline":"Apr 1 - Apr 30"},{"phase":"Operations & Field Service (Phase 2)","scope":"Operational management setup, Phase 2 planning","timeline":"May 1 - May 31"},{"phase":"HR Migration & Final Go-Live","scope":"HR integration with KEKA, project management tools, final deployment","timeline":"Jun 1 - Jun 30"}],"industry":"Food & Beverage / Vending Operations","is_deleted":false,"links":["https://www.zoho.com"],"milestones":[{"date":"2025-02-28","title":"Financials, VAT, and Core Setup"},{"date":"2025-03-31","title":"Sales, Purchase, Inventory & CRM"},{"date":"2025-04-30","title":"Integrations & Analytics"},{"date":"2025-05-31","title":"Operations & Field Service (Phase 2)"},{"date":"2025-06-30","title":"HR Migration & Final Go-Live"}],"objectives":"- Centralize business operations across finance, sales, inventory, and HR\n- Improve data visibility for informed decision-making\n- Automate workflows for sales, purchases, and inventory management\n- Implement CRM for managing vending locations and customer accounts\n- Establish operational management processes and project collaboration tools\n- Integrate HR functions with KEKA and migrate to Zoho People\n- Provide consolidated dashboards and analytics for performance tracking","parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":"proposal-4402d1ac-8ad4-4a5a-9907-187f1e6abcf1","rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"Implementation of finance, VAT, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, HR, integrations, and analytics using Zoho ecosystem","scope_of_work":"## Project Objectives\n- Implement a fully integrated Zoho business management system covering finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR.\n- Consolidate functions for improved data visibility and efficiency.\n\n## Modules and Functional Scope\n### A. Financial Management\n- **Chart of Accounts Setup:** Configuration based on FreshNow's financial structure.\n- **Accounts Receivable and Payable Management:** Streamlined processes for tracking incoming and outgoing payments.\n- **Cash and Bank Transactions:** Management and reconciliation processes.\n- **Budgeting and Cost Center Tracking:** Implementation of budget tracking for better financial oversight.\n- **Multi-Currency and VAT Compliance:** Ensure compliance with UAE VAT regulations through Zoho Books.\n- **Dashboards:** Creation of financial dashboards for cash flow, margins, and P&L reporting.\n\n### B. VAT and Compliance\n- **VAT Configuration:** Set up for UAE FTA compliance.\n- **Automated VAT Return Filing:** Streamlining of VAT reporting processes.\n- **Audit Trail:** Maintenance of a comprehensive VAT audit trail.\n\n### C. Sales and Receivables\n- **Customer Master and Credit Control:** Centralized customer database.\n- **Sales Order Management:** Automation of the sales order, delivery, and invoicing workflows.\n- **TeleVend Integration:** Real-time data synchronization from vending machines.\n- **Sales Reporting:** Generation of customer-wise sales reports.\n\n### D. Purchases and Payables\n- **Vendor Management:** Establishment of vendor profiles and performance tracking.\n- **Purchase Order Processes:** Automation of requisition and approval workflows.\n- **Expense Allocation:** Efficient tracking of expenses and vendor reconciliation.\n\n### E. Inventory Management\n- **Multi-Location Tracking:** Management of inventory across warehouses and vending machines.\n- **Stock Management:** Alerts for stock levels and adjustments.\n- **Real-Time Integrations:** Integration with TeleVend for stock data analysis.\n\n### F. CRM and Customer Support\n- **CRM Setup:** Configuration of Zoho CRM for managing over 90 vending locations.\n- **Customer Interaction Tracking:** Integration of customer feedback and complaint tracking.\n\n### G. Operational and Field Service Management (Phase 2)\n- **Field Route Planning:** Optimization of service routes using Google Maps.\n- **Service Scheduling:** Management of technician schedules and service history.\n\n### H. HR Management\n- **KEKA Integration:** Phase 1 integration for attendance and payroll management.\n- **Migration to Zoho People:** Transitioning to Zoho People for HR functionalities.\n\n### I. Project Management and Collaboration\n- **Project Tracking:** Implementation of project and campaign management tools.\n- **Collaboration Tools:** Setup of file sharing and task assignment features.\n\n### J. Reporting and Analytics\n- **Consolidated Dashboards:** Creation of dashboards for KPI tracking across departments.\n- **Forecasting:** Implementation of forecasting tools for revenue and stock efficiency.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Custom development outside of Zoho's standard offerings.\n- Advanced data analytics requiring external tools not integrated within Zoho.\n- Legacy data migration (separate engagement).","scope_of_work_introduction":"This proposal outlines the comprehensive implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for **FreshNow Management** in the food and beverage / vending operations industry. The initiative aims to centralize operations, enhance data visibility, automate processes, and facilitate informed decision-making through the Zoho ecosystem. Our approach will align with FreshNow's goals and specific requirements to ensure a successful transformation of business processes.","scope_of_work_summary":"**Key Deliverables:** Zoho Books configuration with UAE VAT compliance, automated workflows for sales, purchases, and inventory, TeleVend integration for real-time vending data, CRM setup for managing vending locations and accounts, operational and field service management (Phase 2), HR integration with KEKA and migration to Zoho People, project management setup, and consolidated analytics dashboards.","start_date":"2025-02-01","status":"approval_pending","submitted_to":["FreshNow"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"End-to-end Zoho business management system implementation for FreshNow","team_members":[{"experience":"8+ years","role":"Zoho Solution Architect"},{"experience":"6+ years","role":"Zoho Finance Consultant"},{"experience":"5+ years","role":"Zoho CRM & Creator Developer"},{"experience":"7+ years","role":"Project Manager"}],"team_structure_min_experience":5,"team_structure_table":[{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Solution Architect","Experience":"8+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Lead implementation strategy, system architecture design, client consultation"},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Finance Consultant","Experience":"6+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Configure Zoho Books, ensure VAT compliance, financial reporting"},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho CRM & Creator Developer","Experience":"5+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Develop CRM functionalities, integrate with TeleVend, customize workflows"},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Project Manager","Experience":"7+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Oversee project timelines, resource allocation, stakeholder communication"}],"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Zoho Implementation Proposal","total_budget":"1000","training_and_support":"## Training Plan\n\nOur implementation includes a comprehensive training program:\n\n- **Zoho System Overview (4 hours):** Introduction to the Zoho ecosystem and navigation\n- **Finance Module Training (6 hours):** Detailed sessions on Zoho Books and VAT compliance\n- **CRM Training (5 hours):** Hands-on training for CRM functionalities and best practices\n- **Operational Management Training (4 hours):** Workflow automation and field service management\n- **HR Module Training (4 hours):** Transitioning to Zoho People and using KEKA integration\n\n## Post-Implementation Support\n\n- **30-day support period:** Dedicated support with a 2-hour response time for critical issues\n- **User Guides and Documentation:** Comprehensive manuals and FAQs for all modules\n- **Access to a Client Portal:** For support ticket submissions and resources","updated_at":"2026-01-15T23:32:43.942Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1}]}
