, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, Sales, Marketing, Business Development, Project Planning and Management, Manpower Management, CRM and Customer Support, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations. The implementation will focus on asset management, fleet management, budgeting and forecasting, contract management, and the integration of AI for enhanced operational efficiency. The project will also involve creating dashboards for each department head, automating processes, and utilizing AI for forecasting and decision-making. Specific functionalities include multi-currency and VAT compliant accounting, automated VAT return filing, real-time sales reporting, vendor management, multi-location inventory tracking, field route planning, contract management, and performance KPIs. Additionally, the project will include automated workflows for approvals, a centralized customer database, and integration with various Zoho applications to streamline operations.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":null,"status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"Implement a fully integrated Zoho business management system covering finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR.","team_members":[],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)x","total_budget":null,"training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-22T02:18:06.803Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["https://yoxtsymyhtuhdnaszkzq.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/proposal-audio/216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1768893367600-ztn628nto.mp3?token=eyJraWQiO